/* The town beside Cluckington Palace (PREVIEW ONLY: needs ?town=1 in the address; without it #/town/... goes back to #/palace).
   Three buildings:
     #/town/jobs           Job Centre: today's spaced reviews (cards included) as paid jobs
     #/town/butcher[/subj] Bert's Butchers: the end-of-subject test (window.SQE_BERT[subj], falling back to the Model Q&A
                           questions until those files exist) + a link to Face the Butcher (#/boss)
     #/town/shop           Hen Bargains: Britney's shop items, with an optional gamble before a purchase: 10 SRA sample questions,
                           6+ right = half price, fewer = DOUBLE (Monnie 20 Nov). Free items can't be gambled.
   With the flag, the timetable also gets a "Bert's Butchers: <subject> test" slot on the study day after each subject's last learning day.
   Loaded by build.py right before app.js (like scene.js). Defines window.SQE_TOWN(api), called by app.js from inside its closure. Plain ES5.
   Coin values (see proposals/shop-prices.md: about 300 coins on a normal day) are set here: */
