/* ============ PROGRESS SYNC (21 Nov, Monnie) ============
   Layla's ONE link (?me=<code>) makes her progress follow her to any computer. The code is remembered on that browser
   (localStorage "sqe1-sync-code", separate from the save key). Every few minutes, and when the tab is hidden, this pulls the
   shared copy from Monnie's private Google script, MERGES it with this computer's save (nothing is ever dropped: topics, ticks,
   answers, hours and Bert wins are combined; coins add up by each computer's own change since its last sync, so nothing is
   counted twice) and uploads the result. The save key and epoch are untouched. Off in "see it as Layla" mode. */
var SYNC = {code:"", rev:0, busy:0, first:1, last:0};
